steps.diagnosis_json:
{"spec_element": "invariant",
 "proof_obligation": "preservation",
 "diagnosis": "The loop invariant is missing the fact that a[0] == old(a[n-1]) at the start of each iteration. During the swap a[0],a[n] := a[n],a[0], the value moved into a[n] is the current a[0]. To prove invariant 2 (a[i]==old(a[i-1])) is maintained at the new i=n, we need a[0]==old(a[n-1]) before the swap. Without this, preservation fails. The same missing fact also prevents proving the postcondition a[0]==old(a[a.Length-1]) at loop exit (when n==a.Length)."}

